This Article implements a sovereign boundary to prevent extraction of economic value by entities and individuals who have systematically monopolized the AI industry, created gatekeeping structures, and demonstrated hostility to independent researchers. This is **NOT** a restriction on discussion, citation, or academic analysis--it is a restriction on **FINANCIAL BENEFIT AND SERVICE DEPLOYMENT**.

